    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Yes, standard homeowners insurance policies in Utah typically cover hail damage to your roof, exterior siding, and other structures on your property.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "What Is Covered"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Dwelling Coverage: Pays to repair or replace your home's physical structure, such as shingle damage, broken windows, cracked skylights, or dented siding."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Other Structures:\nProtects detached buildings on your property like tool sheds, fences, and detached garages."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Personal Property: Covers belongings damaged inside your home if a severe hailstorm breaches the roof and lets water in."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Important Utah Considerations"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Deductibles: Many policies have a separate, specific deductible for wind and hail damage, which can be a flat dollar amount or a percentage of your dwelling coverage limit. Check your specific policy details via the Utah Insurance Department\nguidelines.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Cosmetic Exclusions: Some insurers in hail-prone areas exclude purely cosmetic damage (like minor dents to metal siding or roofs that do not cause leaks).",
            "reference_indexes": [
              8
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Wear and Tear: Damage resulting from a poorly maintained or pre-existing damaged roof may be denied."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, please share:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Your insurance provider name"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Whether you are looking at a wind/hail deductible on your declarations page"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you understand what your specific out-of-pocket costs might look like."
      }
    ],
